{%- comment -%}
  Emits font-weight + font-style CSS for a text element.
  Params:
    key  — chosen weight/style (optional). Plain hyphenated words only, because
           Shopify select `value`s can't contain quotes/commas (see font-stack.liquid).
    font — the font key in use (site|display|text|ogg). Used to pick a sensible
           DEFAULT weight when the merchant hasn't overridden `key`.

  Why the font-aware default exists: theme.css sets headings to font-weight 500
  (--fw-medium) and .hero h1 to 200. Ogg ships a real 500 face, so an Ogg heading
  left on "Theme default" renders heavy. Emitting an explicit default here (Ogg
  -> 300 Book) overrides that. This snippet is always rendered AFTER `font-family`
  in the style attribute, so whatever it emits wins over the stylesheet.

  Faces actually published by the Typekit kit (jyd8pzu):
    ogg-text .................. 300 / 400 / 500 / 700 / 800 normal, 300 / 400 / 500 italic
    neue-haas-grotesk-display . 200 / 300 / 400 / 500 normal only
    neue-haas-grotesk-text .... 400 normal only
    neuehaasdisplaylight ...... single local face (400 normal)
  Asking for a face the kit doesn't ship makes the browser synthesize it (faux
  bold / slanted oblique). Add the weight in Adobe Fonts to get the real cut.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- case key -%}
  {%- when 'thin' -%}font-weight:200;font-style:normal;
  {%- when 'book' -%}font-weight:300;font-style:normal;
  {%- when 'book-italic' -%}font-weight:300;font-style:italic;
  {%- when 'roman' -%}font-weight:400;font-style:normal;
  {%- when 'roman-italic' -%}font-weight:400;font-style:italic;
  {%- when 'medium' -%}font-weight:500;font-style:normal;
  {%- when 'medium-italic' -%}font-weight:500;font-style:italic;
  {%- when 'bold' -%}font-weight:700;font-style:normal;
  {%- when 'black' -%}font-weight:800;font-style:normal;
  {%- else -%}
    {%- comment -%} 'inherit' / blank: fall back to the font's natural default. {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- case font -%}
      {%- when 'ogg' -%}font-weight:300;font-style:normal;
    {%- endcase -%}
{%- endcase -%}
